/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_WYR_OpenHand_TieflingVictim_001_Letter</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_WYR_OpenHand_TieflingVictim_001_Letter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_WYR_OpenHand_TieflingVictim_001_Letter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">5754207c-7891-47a2-8450-ee310d73ea04</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:5754207c-7891-47a2-8450-ee310d73ea04\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:5754207c-7891-47a2-8450-ee310d73ea04\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Brekka\" title=\"Brekka\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/ff/Portrait_Brekka.png/25px-Portrait_Brekka.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/ff/Portrait_Brekka.png/38px-Portrait_Brekka.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/ff/Portrait_Brekka.png/50px-Portrait_Brekka.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Brekka\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/ff/Portrait_Brekka.png/25px-Portrait_Brekka.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/ff/Portrait_Brekka.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Brekka\" title=\"Brekka\">Brekka</a>, who can be found in <a href=\"/wiki/Open_Hand_Temple_Cellar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Open Hand Temple Cellar\">Open Hand Temple Cellar</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;90&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-1049</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[This letter is written in the careful but erratic hand of a newly-learned writer.]\n</p><p><br>\nMum says I need to say 'thank you' more - so THANK YOU! Thank you for telling off that nasty woman who was shouting all those nasty things at me. That's three times I've wrote 'thank you' now (four!) so I think mum'll be happy. One more thing - did you see my teddy anywhere? I think I dropped it during all the shouting...\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202340\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1612/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26278/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6963/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935682/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.721      1 Template:MiscItemPage